<title>SWITZERLAND: Winterthur to expand telephone service.</title>
<headline>Winterthur to expand telephone service.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winterthur Insurance Co subsidiary Swissline said it will expand its phone and internet sales to include household insurance and personal liability insurance.</p>
<p>Swissline already offers car insurance by phone, and via internet.</p>
<p>The expanded service will be offered first in German-speaking Switzerland, and will be expanded to include western Switzerland in the spring.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
